\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 q. (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Von eins menschen eigen engel.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O du mein besondern von dem almechtigen got zu gefugten hailigem engel, ich armer }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [119}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  sonder beuilch mich dir heutte}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Collecte.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Got, mit des fursichtigkeit wirt gehanntreichte ... verleihe \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [121r]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  mir gnediclichen  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 GW 12995}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. y2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash y5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; Trier, Stadtbibl., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hs. 819/10 8\u176 \'b0}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; au\u223 \'dferdem Budapest, Sz\u233 \'e9ch\u233 \'e9nyi-Nationalbibliothek, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501