\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 t. (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Christophorus (25.7.). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Von sannt Cristoffel.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O wie wunderbarlich ist die crafft des seligmacher, in der du, o hailiger sant Cristoffel auch hailwertig worden ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 (126}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  geruch mich armen sunder}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vor dem almechtigen got soliche genad zu erwerben ...  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 GW 12995}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. w2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash w3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; Trier, Stadtbibl., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hs. 819/10 8\u176 \'b0}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; au\u223 \'dferdem Augsburg, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cod. I.3.8\u176 \'b0 10}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schne