\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 v. (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) Konrad von Konstanz (26.11.). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Von sant Cunrad.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O hochwirdiger bischof, hailiger herr sant Cunrad, du bist der, den die ewige weyshait gottes ... ich armer sunder ruf dich an}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  diem\u252 \'fcttigliche, bit fur mich Jhesum ...  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 GW 12995}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. A8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash B1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; Trier, Stadtbibl., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hs. 819/10 8\u176 \'b0}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . }

