\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dicta}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22 , Bernhard und Augustinus zugeschrieben\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bernhart}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dc luter gemu}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 t ist diu gezierde der guoten consciencie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... Er sprichit och: Dc gemu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 t sol sin vri, dc ez dehain freuiliu heftunge behefte ... Sanctus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sprichit: Diu tuginde kv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 schekait machit den menschin den lu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ten lussan ...\u8722 - ... vnd geschendet die tieuil vnd besliuzet die helle.}

