\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 b. (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Passionspredigt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Wie vnser herre ru\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 we su\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 chet.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In omnibus requiem quesiui etc. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [Sir 24,11].}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  Vnser herre Ihesus Cristus, der ware gotiz sun, der clagit sinim vater}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  v\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 bir alle die, die er von dem ewigen tode hat erlo\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 set, vnd sprichit: In omnibus, scilicet meo sanguine redemptis, requiem quesiui ... In allen den, sprichit er, die ich mit minem blu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 t erlo\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 set han, da han ich ru\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 we gesu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 chit vnd han dehaine wnden ... \u8722 - ... Vor disin zorne behu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 t uns got alle, dc wir der ewigun rv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 we ich verstozin werdin. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Karlsruhe, BLB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Donaueschingen 204}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (Inc. bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Schmid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , S. 65, Anm. 34).}

