\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Mystischer Text vom Wort Gottes in der Seele}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nu spricht sant {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Paul}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Der kuz dez obrostin gotiz vnd gu}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 tez, der sol iuwer vernunft erlu}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 hten}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Dc ist dc wort, dc got mit der sel redet, dauon diu sel enzundet wirt. Man uindet in dem ewangelio: Do unsir herre erstandin wc uon dem tode, do kam er zv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 zwain sinen iungirn vf dem wege ... do er mit vns redde vnd vnsir herze enbrant wart von siner rede. Diu sel wirt recht enzundet, so got mit ir redet ... \u8722 - ... Da werdent si gehailiget vnd geminnet vnd geeret vnd gelobit in der rechtun warhait vnd in de worte, dc got selber ist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Augsburg, UB, III.1.4\u176 \'b0 9}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, Cgm 717}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; ebd., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cgm 4490}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Au\u223 \'dferdem: ebd., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cgm 4306}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 358\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -364\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; ebd., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[4].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cgm 839}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Zu den Hss. s. o. Bl. 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

