\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Lat. Gebete und Suffragien zum Hl. Erasmus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Domine in uirtute\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CAO 2349}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Laudate pueri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB g00290}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Domine, exaudi ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Infirmitatem nostram respice, omnipotens deus, et quia pondus proprie actionis gravat, beati Erasmi martiris tui atque pontificis  intercessio gloriosa nos protegat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 O sancte Erasme, martir dei preciose, qui domino nostro Ihesu Christo in dominica die oblatus fuisti ... exaudi me indignissima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [m] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 peccatricem et accipe oblacionem et elemosinam meam pro vita et anima ipsius et pro omnibus necessitatibus eius, et rogo te, ut des sibi victum et vestitum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 O sancte Erasme, martir dei preciose ... libera eum ab omnibus et miseriis et angustiis et calamitatibus, quibus aggravatur ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Da, queso, domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu Criste, sibi de tribulacione leticiam ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Protector in te sperantium deus et fortitudo, qui beatum Erasmum ... de ardore sulphuris picisque misericorditer liberasti, te rogamus et petimus, ut mentes nostras \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  non exurat flamma viciorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Deus, cuius virtute beatus Erasmus martir universa sua superavit tormenta, fac nos eius meritis cunctas insidias inimici superare ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Vnd an dem svnnentag ain almv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 sen gen ald aber ain messe frvmen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Danach mit kleinerer Schrift und dunklerer Tinte: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Wer dis gebet liset, dem gebrist niemer ere noch zergankliches gv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 tes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .  Abdruck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Holder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  1877 (s. o. Lit.), S. 281f.  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung zu den Gebeten Bl. 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  und 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 D\u252 \'fcsseldorf, ULB, Ms. C 73}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8722 -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Raum Aachen, 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte 16. Jh.), zu dem Gebet Bl. 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Basel, UB, B XI 24}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Bl. 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Basel, Dominikanerinnen des Steinenklosters, Ende 15. Jh.).}

