\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\u8722 -v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Lat. Gebet um Schutz in allen Gefahren}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Defende me, domine, ab igne et a fulgure, a tonitruo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... ab omnibus malis, ab oculis malorum, a verbis, a periculis ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 \u8722 - ... libera me, domine, ab invidiis et malignis, a veneficiis libera me, domine, ante mortem et in morte a perpetua morte. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 Danach in kleinerer Schrift:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1  Dis gebet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1  [ist] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 gar gv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\cf1 t fv\u180 \'b4r alles v\u180 \'b4bel vnd f\u180 \'b4vr alles vngelv\u180 \'b4ke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   Abdruck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Holder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  1877 (s. o. Lit.), S. 280.}

