\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 84v99v \plain \f2\caps\lang1033\fs24 Anna-Offizium\plain \f2\caps\lang1033\fs24 , lat.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Di\u223 \'df sind die vii zittle von der hochwirdigen mu\plain \f2\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 tter santt Annen, der erlichen gro\u223 \'dfmu\plain \f2\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 tter Criste, die magstu ir betten, wen du gnad hast. Dis\u223 \'df ist die mette. \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 [85\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 O domina, matter mattris redemptoris Anna nobillissima, que jam rengnans cum angelis coronata in gloria, ibi nostra memor esto ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (85\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Antiphon.< Mattrem fecunde virginis mattris dei et hominis ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (86\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Versus.< Vidi speciosam sicut columbam ...\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  [CAO 5407]. (86\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Oremus.< Deus, qui beattam Annam, delecte genitricis tue, matrem egregiam, ad celestia gaudia pervenire fecisti, concede propicius, vt ipsius interces\u223 \'dfione ...\~\~... ut intercessione beate Anne, quam matrem esse matris filii tui confitemur ad eternam salutem pervenire mereamur. Per eum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 Offizium vom Eucharistiesakrament\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 , lat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Di\u223 \'df ist ain loblicher curs\u223 \'df de corpore Cristi. Bett mit flis\u223 \'df. Domine labia. Deus in. Corperis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 misterium pange glo\u223 \'dfe aque Cristi sanguinis lingua precio\u223 \'dfi qui ob mundi preci[100v]um ventris ...\~\~... contritus et previa satisfaccione valeam te sumere cum devocione. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    Ed.: AH 30, S. 29, Nr. 10. }

