\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 7}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 va}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8722 -10}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 rb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Predigt Nr. 3}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Erunt signa in sole et luna et stellis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Lc 21,25]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Do vnsir herre vf ertriche wandilote in menschlichir nature, do sprach er dis\u250 \'fa wort zuo sinen iungirn}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vnde wizsagote in ain k\u250 \'fanftich dinch. Ez sun zachin geschehin an\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 der sunnen vnd an dem manen vnd an den sternen. Sanctus Iohannes scribet in Apocalypsi, der sah vier engil vliegen vz aime altir \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Apc 8,12]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \u8722 - ... Also sprichit der wissage: In deme himilschin lande ist d\u250 \'fa vro\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de also groz, daz da t\u250 \'fasint iar sint alse der tach, der zirgangen ist \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Ps 89,4]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schiewer/Seidel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 12\u8722 -18, Nr. 3; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rieder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 102\u8722 -109, Nr. 38; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kern\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 189\u8722 -196, Nr. 2; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Wackernagel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1876, S. 92\u8722 -97, Nr. XLVI (nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Freiburg i.Br., UB, Hs. 464}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).}

