\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 10}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 rb}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8722 -15}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 rb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Predigt Nr. 4}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stephanus autem plenus gratia et fortitudine faciebat signa magna et prodigia in populo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Act 6,8]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Dis\u250 \'fa wort sprichit sanctus Lucas in der epistel vnd d\u250 \'fa wort sprechint alsuz}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Stephanus waz vol gnadon vnde stercki vnde tet gro\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 z\u250 \'fa zaichin an deme volcke. Hie an sun wir vier dinch merckin: Stephanus daz sprichit ain regil\u230 \'e6 ... \u8722 - ... Den willen het denne der mensche irweckit mit u\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 bunge gu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tir werche, so ist daz zachin geschehin.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schiewer/Seidel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 18\u8722 -28, Nr. 4; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rieder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 109\u8722 -118, Nr. 39; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kern\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 196\u8722 -210, Nr. 3; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Wackernagel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1876, S. 522\u8722 -531 (nach dieser Hs.).}

