\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 57}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 rb}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8722 -64}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 vb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Predigt Nr. 19}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In illa autem, que sursum est Iherusalem libera est, que est mater nostra }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Gal 4,26]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Alsus sprichit sanctus Paulus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Jherusalem, d\u250 \'fa da obinan lit, diu da vrie ist, d\u250 \'fa ist v\u180 \'b4nsir mu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tir. Diz wort ist gesprochin uon der himilschun Iherusalem. Nv merkint vier dinc: Dc erste ist, dc si hohe lit und da uon ist sichir ... \u8722 - ... Wan siv irkennent, daz elliv gu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ti in gotte vnde uon gotte vluzzet, vnde also wirt gebraitet ir herce \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in der ewigun minne.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schiewer/Seidel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 117\u8722 -132, Nr. 19; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rieder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 207\u8722 -220, Nr. 54; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kern\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 309\u8722 -328, Nr. 13.}

