\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 64}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 vb}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8722 -69}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Predigt Nr. 20}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Missus est angelus Gabriel ad Mariam virginem desponsatam Ioseph }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Lc 1,27]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Alsus scribit Lucas an deme ewangelio vnde lobot unsir vrown an siben sundirlichen tuginden}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Er sprach: Ain engil wart gesant von gotte, der waz gehaizin Gabriel ... Nu merkint disiv wort: Vnsir liebiv vrowe div ist zem erst gelobit an rehtir k\u250 \'fazschichait ... \u8722 - ... Do si deme engile entwrte, Mir geschehe nah dinen worten, do wart got mensche dur vns, do wart erf\u250 \'fallit allir siner wisagon wort.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schiewer/Seidel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 132\u8722 -140, Nr. 20; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rieder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 221\u8722 -228, Nr. 55; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kern\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 328\u8722 -339, Nr. 14.}

