\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 107}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ra}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8722 -108}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Predigt Nr. 33}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 V\u180 \'b4nsir vro}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 we sprichit alsus uon ir selbun: Ego quasi vitis fructificavi [Sir 24,23]. Ich bin ain fruhtb\u230 \'e6riv rebe}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Disiv su\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ziv vnde disv edil rebe, div het sibin bletir, vnde bi dien sibin blettirn sint bezaichint sibin wort, div sprach div geertriche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maria ... \u8722 - ... Der win, der an disime truben \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 waz, daz waz div hohe gothait unsirs herren gottes, daz waz der su\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ze kippirwin, den man ze himilriche gar uollicliche schenchit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schiewer/Seidel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 217\u8722 -220, Nr. 33; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rieder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 302\u8722 -303, Nr. 69; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ern\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 400\u8722 -406, Nr. 21.}

