\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 2}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Benediccio bona deinde karacteres Leonis pape, qui missus erat regi Cipry, contra omnia pericula corporis et anime.< + {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pax domini nostri Jhesu Cristi et victus sacratissime passionis eius et sig+num sancte crucis et integritas beatissime virginis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... sint inter me et omnes inimicos meos ... et contra omnia pericula corporis et anime mee ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  }

