. 301}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hagenmaier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1980, S. 63); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paris, BN, Ms. lat. 1180}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1927, Bd. 1, S. 122).}

