\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 c. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 6}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r\endash v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Alia de Maria.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Virginum o virgo et pya domina sancta Maria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , fac mecum misericordiam tuam in illa hora, quando lingua mea pre morte durissima se movere non possit ...\~\endash \~... felici gaudio congaudent in secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karlsruhe, BLB, Cod. Lichtenthal 106}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; ebd., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cod. Lichtenthal 109}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Heinzer\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 /Stamm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1987, S. 259); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paris, BN, Ms. lat. 10526}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leroquais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1927, Bd. 1, S. 315).}

