\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 b. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 13}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \endash 16}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec est regina virginum, que genuit regem celorum, ipsa intercedat pro peccatis et angustiis meis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . >Magnificat anima mea dominum.< Sancta Maria, mater domini ... veni in adiutorium michi ... >Et exultavit spiritus meus in deo, salutari meo.< Sub tuam proteccionem confugio ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sicut erat in principio et nunc.< Sancta Maria, dei genitrix ... rogo te, ut cum choris virginum sanctarumque animarum ... Letificet et adjuvet nos, quesumus, omnipotens et misericors dominus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kombination von Magnificat (Lc 1,46\endash 55; rubrizierte Verse) und einem Gebet an Maria um Hilfe in N\u246 \'f6ten.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

