\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 d. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 61}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \endash 64}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Drei Sterbegebete. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Wenn der sterbend mensch in die z\u252 \'fcg gryft, so sprecht die iii Pater noster.< Kyrieleyson, Cristeleyson, Kyrieleyson, Pater noster, Ave Maria. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gesundmacher der welt, erlo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u223 \'df vns von der o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 wigen pin}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , du, der vns erlo\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 st hast an dem hailigen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cr\u252 \'fccz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Zu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dem andern mal sprich aber< Kyrieleyson ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hailig vnd zaichen vns mit dem zaichen des hailgen cr\u250 \'facz, das es sy for vns}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Zu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dem dr\u252 \'fctten mal sprich aber.< Kyrieleyson ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Herr, beschirm, mach sa}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 lig, gebenedy vnd hailig din dienerin durch das zaichen des hailigen cr\u252 \'fccz}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\~\endash \~... vnd thu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ir wff die th\u252 \'fcr des o\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 wigen lebens, sich zu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  er\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fro\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 wen vnd zu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  glorieren in der o\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 wigen sa\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ligkait. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

