\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 68}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \endash 70}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet zur Vorbereitung auf den Tod}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 By ainem sterbenden menschen. Zvm ersten von de\u223 \'df menschen sterben die go\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tlichen lerer sprechent, das fast nutzlich vnd gu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t wa\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ri, das der mensch in gesunden tagen sin sterben got dem almechtigen uff oppferty ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O himelscher vatter in der o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 wikait, ich opferen dir iecz die stund mines todes vnd secz die in dinen go}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 tlichen willen}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\~\endash \~... das ich mit dinen verkla\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rten f\u250 \'fanff minn zaichen gelediget werd zu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dem brunnen de\u223 \'df ewigen leben\u223 \'df. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Freiburg, UB, Hs. 79}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eichst\u228 \'e4tt, UB, Cod. st 280}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karlsruhe, BLB, Cod. Donaueschingen 364}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; ebd.,  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cod. Lichtenthal 105}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[4].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stuttgart, WLB, Cod. Don. A III 54}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bl. 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. http://www.manuscripta-mediaevalia.de/dokumente/html/obj31587995 (Katrin Sturm).}

