\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 b. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 71}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \endash 73}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sieben Dinge f\u252 \'fcr einen guten Tod}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Beati mortui, qui in domino moriuntur }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Apc 14,13]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . Der mensch sol s\u252 \'fcben ding thon, das er wol sterbe}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Das erst, er sol ymmer dar fast betten lutt den globen oder das pater noster ...\~\endash \~... Das s\u252 \'fcbend, er sol sin sel got enpfelhen, offt jehen, ymmer dar hilff mir, herr got, bi\u223 \'df mir gna\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dig ... Also hat der herr Cristus och sin sel enpfolhen sinem himelschen vatter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

