\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 f. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 78}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \endash 79}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sterbegebet zu Christus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Zu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  got dem sun.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aller suessester herr Ihesu Criste, vmb die ere vnd krafft dine\u223 \'df aller hailgosten lyden\u223 \'df so verschaff mich empfangen werden in die zal diner usserwelten}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\~\endash \~... Das ich dir in miner letsten angst vnd not och zu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  o\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 wigen zyten lob vnd ere vnd danck sage. Amen. >Deo gracias.<}

