\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 83}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \endash 91}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Stundengebete f\u252 \'fcr die Tage der Karwoche, \u252 \'fcberwiegend lat}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Die collecten in der marter wochen an der mitwochen. Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Respice, domine, super hanc familiam tuam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  >An den antla\u223 \'dftag ze meten. Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Jhesu Criste, qui passurus advenisti propter nos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [CAO 8446]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Kyrieleyson, Christeleyson, Kyrieleyson. >Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui prophetice promisisti: Ero mors tua}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Die vers li\u223 \'dft die priorin.< Credo in deum. >Psalmus.< Miserere mei, deus. .. >Collecta.< Deus, a quo et Judas ... \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >An dem karfrytag ze meten nach der antifon \u250 \'faber Benedictus die ver\u223 \'df. Jhesu Criste, qui passurus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [s.\~o.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... >Ad primam psalmus.< Deus in nomine tuo ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >An dem osteraubent die ver\u223 \'df.< Jhesu Criste, qui passurus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [s.\~o.] ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ad primam psalmus.< Deus, in nomine ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (88v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ad nonam psalmus< Mirabilia. >Psalmus.< Clamavi. >Psalmus.< Principes. >Antiphona.< Cristus factus. >Versus.< Proprio filio. Pater noster. >Psalmus.< Miserere mei. >Oracio.< Respice, domine, super.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >An dem antla\u223 \'df tag, wenn man das trincken segnet zu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  der mandat die collect.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus, qui in deserti regione multitudinem populi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ... saciasti ... >Wenn man den gesten die fu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u223 \'df wescht, so li\u223 \'dft man die ver\u223 \'df.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Suscepimus deus misericordiam tuam in medio templi tui}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...  >Oracio.< Adesto, domine, officiis nostre servitutis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ze metin.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Komm, hailger gaist, ze meti zyt als ain wirt in sin hu\u223 \'df}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... >Ze prim.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Komm, hailger gaist, ze prim zyt als ain ingeladette gast}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\~\endash \~... >Ze complett.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Komm, hailger gaist, zu}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  complet zyt als ain bilgerin vnd bitt dich, lieber herr, mach mich wirdig}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , das du selbs der wirt vnd ynwoner syest in miner sel. Amen.}

