\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 93}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \endash 96}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Betrachtung \u252 \'fcber das Leiden Christi am \u214 \'d6lberg}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Von dem o\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lberg.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Do der herr Jhesus Cristus uff dem o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 lberg was in siner angstha}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 fftiger grimmen}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , windender, grosser not, die so recht achlich vnd so weelich was, das er da swiczet blu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tigen schwai\u223 \'df ...\~\endash \~... z\u252 \'fctrend vnd bydmend, zan klaffen, hercz vnd glider knastlend vnd brastlend, tieff se\u252 \'fcnfftzen, gruntlich heggczen vnd schnipszen, inninglichs wainen von herczen vnd von ougen. Ach vatter, ich bitt dich f\u252 \'fcr sie, bi\u223 \'df ir gna\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dig. >Vom o\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lberg.<\plain \f1\