?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 llend thon in tods no}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 tten}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Item ob du wilt, magstu betten in die angst xxx Pater noster oder was dich din andacht wy\u223 \'dft minder oder mer. Item magst och betten den psalmen Exaudi ...< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ich ermanen dich, herr Jhesu Christe, das du bekantest in dinem inwendigen sterben das du genidert vnd geto}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 tt soltest werden}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... vnd lo\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 se mich von allen tru\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 bsa\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lmen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~[!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 an sel vnd an lib. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

