\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 372\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lat. Gebet zu Maria um einen guten Tod}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (nur Schluss erhalten). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...tissima trinitate et te perlustravit, ut sicut sol radiens in virtute totum celum illuminat, ita illumina me in hora mortis mee lumine fidei et cognicionis, ne fides mea, ignorancia aut aliquo errore temptetur. Ave Maria. \endash  Rogo te, mater clemencie et pietatis, ut sicut spiritus sanctus suavitatem sui amoris plenisime tibi infudit ... ita assis mihi in hora mortis mee infundendo anime mee suavitatem sui amoris ...}

