\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Helena-Offizium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Erste Vesper:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hystoria de sancta Helena regina.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >In primis vesp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [er]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 is antiphona super psalmo.<  Annua beate Helene sollempnia votis laudibus excipiamus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB 206181}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Capitulum.< Mulierem fortem quis inveniet ... >Responsorium.< O mira et potens ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB 604981}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ymnus.< Factor orbis et omnium in orbe subsistentium, dirige clemens mencium tibi vota psallentium ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH 4, S. 150, Nr. 274}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur Magnificat.< O gloriosa regina, que in terreno honore ... >Oratio.< Deus, qui ecclesie tue per beatam Helenam pacis et consolacionis remedia contulisti ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Matutin:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Ad mattutinas invitatorium.< Adoremus regem regum dominum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB 100354}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. [53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ymnus ut in vesperis. Psalmi de virginibus. >Antiphone.< Ingenuis orta natalibus beata Helena ut luna inter sidera ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB 206184}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Antiphona.< Helena Constantini mater Iherosolimam peciit, alleluja. >Antiphona.< Helena sancta dixit ad Judam: Comple desiderium meum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Acht Lektionen (mit Antiphonen und Responsorien): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Lectio prima.< Hodierna igitur dies annua nobis exultacione innovative, in qua mater et gloriosa regina Helena ... >Lectio viii.< Statuti sunt autem duo, quorum unus erat Zenophilus, alter vero Craton philosophus ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Laudes, Terz, Sext, Non und zweite Vesper:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Antiphone ad laudes.< Beata Helena ut virtutem miraculorum in beato Silvestro vidit, in deum et Cristum eius credidit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB 206190}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . >Antiphona.< Abiectis itaque imperialibus humiliata est ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[6].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB 206191}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad tertiam capitulum.< >Ad sextam capitulum.< Mulierem fortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ma<num misit ad forcia ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[7].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB 604986}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Ad nonam capitulum.< Fallax gratia et vana est pulchritudo ... >In secundis vesperis antiphone ad laudem, psalmi de virginibus, capitulum, ymnus et versus, ut in primis vesperis. Antiphona ad Magnificat. Filie regum.< >Oracio.< Omnipotens sempiterne deus, qui in sanctis tuis facis mirabilia, exaudi preces populi tui ... et signo salutifere crucis a cunctis inimicis visibilibus et invisibilibus fideliter protegantur. Per dominium nostrum et fidelium etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Messformular zum Fest der hl. Helena}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur officium misse de sancta Helena.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Officium ad missam.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gaudeamus omnes in domino diem festum celebrantes in honore Helene regine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\~\endash \~... >Offertorium. Filie regum.< >Commune. Diffusa est.< >Completorium.< Supplices te rogamus operis, sempiterne deus, ut beata Helena interveniente et tua in nobis dona multiplices et tempora nostra semper in bono disponas per deum. >Memorare novissima.< Sciendum hoc festum agitur proxima die post octavam Laurencie scilicet in die Agapiti, sed propter octavam gloriosissime virginis Marie transfertur aut anticipatur. Laus deo 92.}

