\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 425\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22 Kolophon der Schreiberin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Sit laus deo. Finitus est libellum in octava sancti Francisci \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [11.Okt.]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  anno a nativitate domini 1572 per juvenem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sorores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  radiert] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 nomine s. Ottilia Schede in Maria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Rosarium ordinis sanctissime virginis Clare. Orate deum pro me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .<  Zum Kolophon vgl. oben Geschichte.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 425\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 428\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  leer.}

