\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Passionsgebet}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 , dt.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Her, ich ermanen dich diner hochen }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [18}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  minne}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vnd diner gu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ti vnd diner willigen armu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t vnd diner hailgen arbait vnd diner hailgen f\u250 \'fanf wunden ...\~\endash \~... vnd mit dinem hailgen blu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t, daz uon dinem hertzen flos, min sel l\u250 \'fatrist vnd raini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gest uon allen mausen, die min sel ie enpfieng. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

