\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 36}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \endash 42}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Brief Christi an den K\u246 \'f6nig Abgar als Schutz in allen Gefahren}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Vorrede:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rex Abagar orauit et dixit ter: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nunc, Criste Ihesu, qui me liberare dignatus es}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 isto prelio, precor te, qui istas litteras super se portauerit scriptas, ut scriptum est, de omni malo saluus sit. Et uox de celo clamauit di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cens: Rex Abagar, peticionem, quam petisti, a me fiat tibi, sicut petisti. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Text des Briefs:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Epistola.< >Incipit epistola saluatoris domini nostri Ihesu Cristi,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam manu sua propria scripsit et misit Abagaro regi Persarum dicens:< Beatus es, Abagare rex, qui me non uidisti et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in me credidisti ...\~\endash \~... et nemo inimicorum tuorum tibi dominabitur, sed in omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et per omnia saluus eris. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Schutzwirkung:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Dico uobis: Quicumque hanc supradictam epistolam secum habuerit, securus ambulet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen.<  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ed. dieser Fassung: Dom C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Skemer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Binding Words. Textual Amuletts in the Middle Ages, Pennsylvania 2006, S. 289f.; Ed. eines abweichenden Texts: Ernst \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 von Dobsch\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 tz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Christusbilder. Untersuchungen zur christlichen Legende, Leipzig 1899, S. 130**\endash 140** Beilage III, bes. S. 133**. \endash  Zum Gebrauch des Abgar-Briefs als Amulett vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 St\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 be\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Abgarsage, in: Hwb.dt.Abergl. 1, Sp. 87\endash 89; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bozoky\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2003, S. 50; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Skemer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2006, S. 96\endash 104 (mit weiterer Lit.). }

