\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 b. (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dextera domini me defendat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que sanctos suos semper adiuuat ... Tibi, domine, commendo animam meam et corpus meum ... ut me confortare digneris omnibus diebus uite mee. Amen. Benedictio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dei patris omnipotentis et filii et spiritus sancti descendat super me et maneat semper. Amen. In manus tuas, domine, commendo spiritum meum, redemisti me,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 domine deus, ueritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

