\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Bernhard von Clairvaux}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 \u8218 \'82{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Salve mundi salutare}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 \lquote \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Bernhardus de passione domini.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Salue, mundi salutare, / aue, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [82}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Ihesu, salue, care}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , / cruci tue me aptare / vellem vere, tu scis quare / da mihi tui copiam ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\endash \~... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum me iubes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 emigrare, / Ihesu bone, tunc appare, / o amator amplectende, / temetipsum tunc ostende / in crvce salutifera. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Edition: PL 184, Sp. 1319\endash 1324; Lit.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , Nr. 18073}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Strophenbestand stellenweise abweichend von der Edition. Bl. 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  dt. Anweisung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Naig dich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , danach Rest der Seite leer, Text geht aber ohne L\u252 \'fccke auf der n\u228 \'e4chsten Seite weiter.}

