\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet zum Hl. Kreuz}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Versus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Adoramus te, Christe}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , et benedicimus tibi, quia per crucem tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 redimisti mundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantus-DB 001287}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus, qui unigeniti filii tui domini nostri Ihesu Cristi precioso sanguine humanum genus redimere dignatus es, concede propicius, ut qui eius adorandam uiuificam crvcem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 adueniunt, a peccatorum suorum nexibus liberemur. Per dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [CO 2149]. \endash  Rest der Seite und 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

