\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rosenkranz in Lat. Versen}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24  (aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Salicetus}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 : '{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antidotarius Animae}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24 ').\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit rosarium beate Marie virginis cum articulis vite Cristi, quod quicumque devote dixerit maximas acquiret indulgencias. Notandum tamen, quod in principio debet dici Credo in deum, postmodum Pater noster, Ave Maria et ante quamlibet clausulam.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave Maria, gracia plena}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... benedictus fructus ventris tui Jhesus Christus. >sine Amen, quia quolibet clausula incipit a relativo qui, quem vel quo, quod refertur ad Jhesum Cristum, et post decem clausulas semper dicantur Pater noster, Credo in deum, Pater noster, Ave Maria.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Suscipe rosarium / virgo deauratum, / Jhesum per conpendium / vita decoratum. >Ave.< Quem virgo carens vicio / de flammine concepisti, / dum Gabrieli nuncio / humillime consensisti. >Ave Maria.< Quo impregnata cicius / cognatam visitasti, / Johannemque celerius / in ventre sanctificasti ...\~\endash \~... Dira qui suplicia est reprobis daturus, / sed electis gaudia eterna collaturus. >Ave Maria.< Orantibus rosarium / aureum tue matris, / Jesu Christe, propicium / fac vultum tui patris. Amen >Versicul.< In omni tribulacione et angustia nostra succurre  nobis ... >Oracio.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nterveniat pro nobis, quesumus, domine Jhesu Christe aput tuam clemenciam gloriosissima tua dei genitrix virgo semper Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH 36, S. 233\endash 236, Nr. 6}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (zur abweichenden Einleitungsstrophe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Suscipe rosarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... vgl. S. 236 [u.\~a. im Antidotarius animae s.l. et a.] und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , Nr. 19951}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). W\u246 \'f6rtlich \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend (auch in Vorrede und Schlussgebet) mit Nicolaus Salicetus: Antidotarius animae, Antwerpen: Gerard Leeu 1490, Bl. 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (GW M39470; Digitalisat: http://daten.digitale-sammlungen.de/0006/bsb00065879/images/). \endash  Zu weiteren gereimten Rosenkr\u228 \'e4nzen vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Klinkhammer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 VL 6 (1987), Sp. 46f.}

