\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 c. (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Alia ad sanctam Mariam sancti Augustini oracio.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Maria, tu illa magna Maria, tu illa mayor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 beatarum Mariarum ... te vult cor meum amare ...
