\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 d. (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Alia oracio ad virginem gloriosam.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave mundi spes Maria, ave mitis, ave pya, ave virgo mater Cristi, tuque sola meruisti esse mater sine viro}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\~\endash \~... Audi nos, nam te filius nichil negans honorat, salva nos, Jhesu, pro quibus virgo mater te orat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck der vier Gebete: Nicolaus Salicetus, Antidotarius animae (s.\~o. zu 186v), Bl. 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (genaue \u220 \'dcbereinstimmung, auch in den \u220 \'dcberschriften).}

