\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anweisungen zum neunmaligen Beten von Psalm 90 und Gloria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item hie nach st\u228 \'e4t ain gu}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 t gebett vnd erho}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 rlich von gott}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , wz du bittest, du solt ix tag alltag ix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mal den psalmen< Qui habitat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ps 90] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >sprechen vnd dz< Gloria in excelsis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Also bett den psalmen vnd< Gloria in excelsis< n\u250 \'fan mal vnder, dristund stend, kn\u250 \'fawint vnd ligend an ainer fengy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (=\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 venie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wz du bittest, wirstu gewert, sunder fu\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 r bo\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sen vnrechten gewalt oder anders.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Text des Gloria mit Marienpreis am Ende: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gloria in excelsis deo ...\~\endash \~... qui sedes ad dexteram patris, miserere nobis, quoniam tu solus sanctus Mariam sanctificans, tu solus dominus Mariam gubernans, tu solus altissimus Mariam coronans, Jhesu Criste, cum sancto spiritu in gloriam est dei patris. Amen.}

