\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Lat.}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ablassgebete}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22  zu den kanonischen Horen, mit Ablass von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Papst Urban}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Urbanus episcopus servus servorum dei singnificamus tam presentibus quam futuris, quod oracionem hanc dicens penitus sub portatus a canonicis horis urgente necessitate insuper c\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et 40 dies indulgenciam. Invitatorium.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 O domine deus omnipotens, o sancta et individua nobilissima trinitas, o beata et benedicta incommutabilis et inconprehensa divinitas ... o adonay, miserere nostri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , recordare, queso, domine, memoria sempiterna, quanto amore nos creasti ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Ad matutinam.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 O rex glorie, domine virtutum, triumphator omnipotens, domine Jhesu Criste ... et tua virtute atque potencia contines universa pro nobis miseris peccatoribus nocturnis horis ...\~\endash \~... et ardeat jugiter in ara cordis mei, flagrat in abscondito anime mee, ut consonmatus inveniar aput te. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .  Druck: Pseudo-Augustinus, Aurelius: Soliloquia. Daran: Urbanus: Suffragia orationum. [K\u246 \'f6ln: Arnold ter Hoernen, um 1477 (=\~{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 GW 3012}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ), Bl. L1r\endash N2v (Digitalisat: https://sammlungen.ub.uni-frankfurt.de/msma/content/pageview/4155638)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

