\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22 Lat. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Gebete}}\plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\caps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 zu den Gliedern Jesu}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro peccatis offertur patri cor Jhesu. [L]audate dominum, omnes gentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . [O] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 pater amantissime, ego offero tibi omne exercicium et meritum sanctissimi cordis dilecti filii tui ... \endash  Os Jhesu offertur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ] [O] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 pater amantissime, ego offero tibi omne exercicium et meritum sanctissimi oris ... \endash  Corpus Jhesu. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ego offero ... meritum omnium menbrorum ... \endash  Anima Jhesu. ...\~\endash \~... quod totis viribus et affectibus animarum nostrarum te sine intermissione diligere et laudare ingrati negleximus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

